   "source": [
    "# Ders 7: Transformers ve Dikkat Mekanizması\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "be96325e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import matplotlib.colors as mcolors\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "print(\"Kutuphaneler hazir.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6fbd5409",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Tokenizasyon ve Gömme (Embedding)\n",
    "\n",
    "Metin → token → gömme vektörü\n",
    "\n",
    "Her token bir **vektörle** temsil edilir (embedding).  \n",
    "Bu vektörler eğitim sırasında öğrenilir.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "0e8f389a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Basit kelime gommesi simulasyonu\n",
    "vocab = [\"the\", \"cat\", \"sat\", \"on\", \"mat\", \"dog\", \"ran\", \"over\", \"a\", \"fence\"]\n",
    "vocab_size = len(vocab)\n",
    "d_model = 4  # gömme boyutu (pratikte 512, 768, 1024 vb.)\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(7)\n",
    "embedding_matrix = np.random.randn(vocab_size, d_model)\n",
    "\n",
    "sentence = \"the cat sat on the mat\"\n",
    "tokens = sentence.split()\n",
    "token_ids = [vocab.index(t) for t in tokens]\n",
    "embedded = embedding_matrix[token_ids]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Cumle: '{sentence}'\")\n",
    "print(f\"Token IDler: {token_ids}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Gomme matrisi sekli: {embedded.shape}\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"Token gomme vektorleri (ilk 3):\")\n",
    "for t, v in zip(tokens[:3], embedded[:3]):\n",
    "    print(f\"  '{t}': {v.round(3)}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Görselleştir\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 4))\n",
    "im = axes[0].imshow(embedding_matrix, cmap='RdBu_r', aspect='auto')\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(f\"Gomme Matrisi ({vocab_size}x{d_model})\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_yticks(range(vocab_size)); axes[0].set_yticklabels(vocab)\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Gomme boyutu\")\n",
    "plt.colorbar(im, ax=axes[0])\n",
    "\n",
    "im2 = axes[1].imshow(embedded, cmap='RdBu_r', aspect='auto')\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(f\"Cumlede Token Gommeleri ({len(tokens)}x{d_model})\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_yticks(range(len(tokens))); axes[1].set_yticklabels(tokens)\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Gomme boyutu\")\n",
    "plt.colorbar(im2, ax=axes[1])\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb07_embedding.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0e8b32ae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Pozisyonel Kodlama (Positional Encoding)\n",
    "\n",
    "Transformer'lar sıra bilgisini içermez. PE bunu sağlar:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$PE(pos, 2i) = \\sin\\left(\\frac{pos}{10000^{2i/d}}\\right)$$\n",
    "$$PE(pos, 2i+1) = \\cos\\left(\\frac{pos}{10000^{2i/d}}\\right)$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "24a21b51",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def positional_encoding(seq_len, d_model):\n",
    "    PE = np.zeros((seq_len, d_model))\n",
    "    position = np.arange(seq_len)[:, None]\n",
    "    div_term = np.exp(np.arange(0, d_model, 2) * (-np.log(10000.0) / d_model))\n",
    "    PE[:, 0::2] = np.sin(position * div_term)\n",
    "    PE[:, 1::2] = np.cos(position * div_term[:d_model//2])\n",
    "    return PE\n",
    "\n",
    "pe = positional_encoding(50, 64)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "im = axes[0].imshow(pe, cmap='RdBu_r', aspect='auto')\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Pozisyonel Kodlama Matrisi (50 pozisyon, 64 boyut)\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Gomme boyutu (d)\"); axes[0].set_ylabel(\"Pozisyon (token sirasi)\")\n",
    "plt.colorbar(im, ax=axes[0])\n",
    "\n",
    "for dim in [0, 1, 4, 8, 16]:\n",
    "    axes[1].plot(pe[:, dim], label=f\"dim={dim}\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Pozisyonel Kodlama: Farkli Boyutlar\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Pozisyon\"); axes[1].set_ylabel(\"Deger\")\n",
    "axes[1].legend(fontsize=8); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb07_pe.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a794c1b0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Scaled Dot-Product Self-Attention (Ch. 12.2)\n",
    "\n",
    "Her token için Query (Q), Key (K), Value (V) vektörleri hesaplanır:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{Attention}(Q, K, V) = \\text{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right) V$$\n",
    "\n",
    "- `Q·Kᵀ`: Her token çifti arasındaki benzerlik\n",
    "- `√d_k` ile ölçekleme: gradyan kararlılığı\n",
    "- Softmax: Normalize dikkat ağırlıkları\n",
    "- `× V`: Ağırlıklı değer toplamı\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9cc22c69",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def softmax(x, axis=-1):\n",
    "    e = np.exp(x - x.max(axis=axis, keepdims=True))\n",
    "    return e / e.sum(axis=axis, keepdims=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "def scaled_dot_product_attention(Q, K, V, mask=None):\n",
    "    d_k = Q.shape[-1]\n",
    "    scores = Q @ K.T / np.sqrt(d_k)\n",
    "    if mask is not None:\n",
    "        scores = scores + mask * -1e9\n",
    "    weights = softmax(scores)\n",
    "    output = weights @ V\n",
    "    return output, weights\n",
    "\n",
    "# Demo: kısa bir cümle\n",
    "np.random.seed(3)\n",
    "seq_len = 6\n",
    "d_k = 8\n",
    "d_v = 8\n",
    "d_model = 8\n",
    "\n",
    "tokens_demo = [\"I\", \"ate\", \"the\", \"green\", \"apple\", \".\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Sahte Q, K, V\n",
    "X = np.random.randn(seq_len, d_model)\n",
    "W_Q = np.random.randn(d_model, d_k) * 0.3\n",
    "W_K = np.random.randn(d_model, d_k) * 0.3\n",
    "W_V = np.random.randn(d_model, d_v) * 0.3\n",
    "\n",
    "Q = X @ W_Q\n",
    "K = X @ W_K\n",
    "V = X @ W_V\n",
    "\n",
    "output, attn_weights = scaled_dot_product_attention(Q, K, V)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "im = axes[0].imshow(attn_weights, cmap='Blues', vmin=0, vmax=1)\n",
    "axes[0].set_xticks(range(seq_len)); axes[0].set_xticklabels(tokens_demo, fontsize=10)\n",
    "axes[0].set_yticks(range(seq_len)); axes[0].set_yticklabels(tokens_demo, fontsize=10)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Self-Attention Agirliklari\\n(Satir = sorgu, Sutun = anahtar)\")\n",
    "plt.colorbar(im, ax=axes[0])\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(seq_len):\n",
    "    for j in range(seq_len):\n",
    "        axes[0].text(j, i, f\"{attn_weights[i,j]:.2f}\", ha='center', va='center',\n",
    "                    fontsize=8, color='black' if attn_weights[i,j] < 0.5 else 'white')\n",
    "\n",
    "im2 = axes[1].imshow(output, cmap='RdBu_r', aspect='auto')\n",
    "axes[1].set_yticks(range(seq_len)); axes[1].set_yticklabels(tokens_demo)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Attention Ciktisi: Context Vektorleri\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Boyut\")\n",
    "plt.colorbar(im2, ax=axes[1])\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb07_attention.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0a772d13",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Multi-Head Attention (Ch. 12.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "Birden fazla dikkat kafası paralel çalışır → farklı ilişki türleri öğrenilir:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{MultiHead}(Q,K,V) = \\text{Concat}(\\text{head}_1, \\ldots, \\text{head}_h) W^O$$\n",
    "$$\\text{head}_i = \\text{Attention}(QW_i^Q, KW_i^K, VW_i^V)$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2bd3f77e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def multi_head_attention(X, n_heads=4, d_k=4, d_v=4):\n",
    "    d_model = X.shape[1]\n",
    "    seq_len = X.shape[0]\n",
    "    all_outputs = []\n",
    "    all_weights = []\n",
    "    \n",
    "    np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "    for h in range(n_heads):\n",
    "        W_Q = np.random.randn(d_model, d_k) * 0.3\n",
    "        W_K = np.random.randn(d_model, d_k) * 0.3\n",
    "        W_V = np.random.randn(d_model, d_v) * 0.3\n",
    "        Q_h = X @ W_Q\n",
    "        K_h = X @ W_K\n",
    "        V_h = X @ W_V\n",
    "        out_h, w_h = scaled_dot_product_attention(Q_h, K_h, V_h)\n",
    "        all_outputs.append(out_h)\n",
    "        all_weights.append(w_h)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    concat_output = np.concatenate(all_outputs, axis=-1)\n",
    "    W_O = np.random.randn(n_heads*d_v, d_model) * 0.3\n",
    "    return concat_output @ W_O, all_weights\n",
    "\n",
    "d_model_demo = 16\n",
    "X_demo = np.random.randn(6, d_model_demo)\n",
    "mha_output, head_weights = multi_head_attention(X_demo, n_heads=4, d_k=4, d_v=4)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 4, figsize=(16, 4))\n",
    "for i, (ax, weights) in enumerate(zip(axes, head_weights)):\n",
    "    im = ax.imshow(weights, cmap='Blues', vmin=0, vmax=1)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f\"Kafa {i+1}\")\n",
    "    ax.set_xticks(range(6)); ax.set_xticklabels(tokens_demo, fontsize=8, rotation=45)\n",
    "    ax.set_yticks(range(6)); ax.set_yticklabels(tokens_demo, fontsize=8)\n",
    "    plt.colorbar(im, ax=ax)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Multi-Head Attention: 4 Kafanin Dikkat Agirliklari\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb07_multihead.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "00f13fba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Causal (Masked) Attention — GPT Stili\n",
    "\n",
    "Dil modellerinde her token yalnızca **geçmiş** tokenlere bakabilir (gelecek tokenler maskelenir).\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "81e851a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Causal mask\n",
    "seq_len_c = 6\n",
    "causal_mask = np.triu(np.ones((seq_len_c, seq_len_c)), k=1)  # 1=mask out\n",
    "\n",
    "X_c = np.random.randn(seq_len_c, d_k)\n",
    "Q_c, K_c, V_c = X_c, X_c, X_c\n",
    "\n",
    "_, causal_weights = scaled_dot_product_attention(Q_c, K_c, V_c, mask=causal_mask)\n",
    "_, full_weights   = scaled_dot_product_attention(Q_c, K_c, V_c, mask=None)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, (name, w) in zip(axes, [(\"Tam Attention (BERT tarzi)\", full_weights),\n",
    "                                  (\"Causal Attention (GPT tarzi)\", causal_weights)]):\n",
    "    im = ax.imshow(w, cmap='Blues', vmin=0, vmax=1)\n",
    "    for i in range(seq_len_c):\n",
    "        for j in range(seq_len_c):\n",
    "            ax.text(j, i, f\"{w[i,j]:.2f}\", ha='center', va='center', fontsize=9)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(name)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel(\"Anahtar konumu (gecmis →)\"); ax.set_ylabel(\"Sorgu konumu\")\n",
    "    plt.colorbar(im, ax=ax)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Encoder (tam) vs Decoder (causal) Self-Attention\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb07_causal.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "859a81b6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Transformer Bloğu\n",
    "\n",
    "Tam bir Transformer enkoderi bloğu:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "x → LayerNorm → MultiHeadAttention → + (skip) → LayerNorm → FFN → + (skip) → çıktı\n",
    "```\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "8dc1873b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def layer_norm(x, eps=1e-6):\n",
    "    mean = x.mean(axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n",
    "    std  = x.std(axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n",
    "    return (x - mean) / (std + eps)\n",
    "\n",
    "def ffn(x, d_ff=32):\n",
    "    d_model = x.shape[-1]\n",
    "    np.random.seed(5)\n",
    "    W1 = np.random.randn(d_model, d_ff) * 0.1\n",
    "    b1 = np.zeros(d_ff)\n",
    "    W2 = np.random.randn(d_ff, d_model) * 0.1\n",
    "    b2 = np.zeros(d_model)\n",
    "    return np.maximum(0, x @ W1 + b1) @ W2 + b2\n",
    "\n",
    "def transformer_block(X):\n",
    "    seq_len, d_model = X.shape\n",
    "    n_heads = 4\n",
    "    d_k = d_model // n_heads\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 1. Sub-layer: Self-attention\n",
    "    X_norm1 = layer_norm(X)\n",
    "    attn_out, _ = multi_head_attention(X_norm1, n_heads=n_heads, d_k=d_k, d_v=d_k)\n",
    "    X = X + attn_out  # Residual\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 2. Sub-layer: FFN\n",
    "    X_norm2 = layer_norm(X)\n",
    "    ff_out = ffn(X_norm2, d_ff=d_model*4)\n",
    "    X = X + ff_out  # Residual\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return X\n",
    "\n",
    "d_model_blk = 16\n",
    "X_blk = np.random.randn(6, d_model_blk)\n",
    "X_out = transformer_block(X_blk)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(12, 4))\n",
    "axes[0].imshow(X_blk, cmap='RdBu_r', aspect='auto')\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Transformer Blogu Giris\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_yticks(range(6)); axes[0].set_yticklabels(tokens_demo)\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"d_model\")\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].imshow(X_out, cmap='RdBu_r', aspect='auto')\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Transformer Blogu Cikis (Ayni boyut)\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_yticks(range(6)); axes[1].set_yticklabels(tokens_demo)\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"d_model\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Transformer Blogu: Giris -> Cikis (sekil korundur)\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb07_block.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8b875612",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. BERT vs GPT Karşılaştırması\n",
    "\n",
    "| Özellik | BERT (Encoder) | GPT (Decoder) |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Attention | Tam (çift yönlü) | Causal (tek yönlü) |\n",
    "| Ön-eğitim | Masked LM | Causal LM |\n",
    "| Kullanım | Anlama görevleri | Üretim görevleri |\n",
    "| Örnek görev | Sınıflandırma, NER | Metin üretme, Chat |\n",
    "\n",
    "## 8. Özet\n",
    "\n",
    "| Kavram | Açıklama |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **Self-Attention** | Her token diğerleriyle ne kadar ilişkili? |\n",
    "| **Q, K, V** | Sorgu, Anahtar, Değer — dikkat hesabının 3 bileşeni |\n",
    "| **Multi-head** | Farklı kafa = farklı ilişki türü öğrenir |\n",
    "| **Causal mask** | Gelecek tokenleri gizle → dil modeli eğitimi |\n",
    "| **Positional Encoding** | Sıra bilgisini gömmeye ekle |\n",
    "| **Transformer blok** | Attention + FFN + Skip + Norm |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Sonraki Notebook →** Üretici Modeller (GAN, VAE, Diffusion)\n"
   ]
  }
